CLASS:Citadel Mystic	HD:8	TYPE:Prestige.PC	STARTSKILLPTS:2	MAXLEVEL:10	CSKILL:Concentration|TYPE=Craft|Diplomacy|Heal|Knowledge (Religion)|Sense Motive|Spellcraft	BONUS:COMBAT|BASEAB|classlevel*3/4	BONUS:SAVE|Fort|CL/2+2	BONUS:SAVE|Ref|CL/3	BONUS:SAVE|Will|CL/2+2	DESC:Healers trained at the Citadel of Light. Necromantic restriction: may not cast necromancy, death or evil spells (the Necromancy school or the Evil or Death descriptors, domain spells included). Ex-Citadel mystic (p.31): one who turns evil or betrays the Citadel loses reputation and heart's grace and cannot advance; reputation becomes a penalty with authorities and the leaders of free peoples (Knights of Solamnia included) until restored.	PRETEXT:Able to cast 2nd-level divine spells without preparation, including at least two different Conjuration (healing) spells	PRETEXT:A graduate of the Citadel of Light	PREALIGN:LG,NG,CG	PRECHECKBASE:1,Will=4	PRESKILL:1,Heal=8	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=8	PRESKILL:1,Diplomacy=4	PRESPELLTYPE:1,Divine=2	SOURCEPAGE:p.30-32
