CLASS:Kender Nightstalker	HD:6	TYPE:Prestige.PC	STARTSKILLPTS:4	MAXLEVEL:10	CSKILL:Balance|Concentration|TYPE=Craft|Diplomacy|Disable Device|Escape Artist|Gather Information|Hide|Listen|Move Silently|Open Lock|TYPE=Profession|Search|Sleight of Hand|Spellcraft|Spot|Survival|Use Magic Device|Use Rope	BONUS:COMBAT|BASEAB|classlevel*3/4	BONUS:SAVE|Fort|CL/3	BONUS:SAVE|Ref|CL/2+2	BONUS:SAVE|Will|CL/2+2	SPELLSTAT:WIS	MEMORIZE:NO	FACT:SpellType|Divine	SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Kender Nightstalker=1|Cure Light Wounds,Deathwatch,Disrupt Undead,Gentle Repose,Ray of Enfeeblement|Kender Nightstalker=2|Consecrate,Cure Moderate Wounds,Ghoul Touch,Restoration (Lesser)|Kender Nightstalker=3|Cure Serious Wounds,Halt Undead,Speak with Dead,Vampiric Touch|Kender Nightstalker=4|Cure Critical Wounds,Death Ward,Neutralize Poison,Restoration	DESC:Kender who speak with the dead. Spells (p.33): divine and spontaneous from the class's own list, Wisdom-based (minimum Wisdom 10 + spell level; save DC 10 + spell level + Wisdom modifier); a 0 on Table 1-7 means bonus spells only. At 6th, 8th and 10th level a known spell may be swapped for another of the same level, two levels below the highest it can cast. Caster level is half the nightstalker level: the app uses the full level, so halve it at the table. Use Magic Device is an exclusive class skill. Table 1-8's footnote says Charisma where every other line says Wisdom; Wisdom is used here.	PRETEXT:Must have encountered an undead creature with Intelligence 3 or higher	PREALIGN:LG,NG,CG	PRERACE:1,Kender,Half-Kender	PRESKILL:1,Bluff=8	PRESKILL:1,Diplomacy=7	PRESKILL:1,Gather Information=8	PRESKILL:1,Sense Motive=6	PRESKILL:1,Spot=6	PREFEAT:1,Great Fortitude	PREFEAT:1,Iron Will	SOURCEPAGE:p.32-34
