CLASS:Nomad Shaman	HD:8	TYPE:Prestige.PC	STARTSKILLPTS:4	MAXLEVEL:10	CSKILL:Concentration|TYPE=Craft|Diplomacy|Handle Animal|Heal|Knowledge (Nature)|Knowledge (Religion)|TYPE=Profession|Spellcraft|Swim|Survival	BONUS:COMBAT|BASEAB|classlevel*3/4	BONUS:SAVE|Fort|CL/3	BONUS:SAVE|Ref|CL/3	BONUS:SAVE|Will|CL/2+2	AUTO:ARMORPROF|ARMORTYPE=Light	AUTO:SHIELDPROF|SHIELDTYPE=Shield	DESC:Spirit-talkers of Ansalon's nomad tribes. Proficient with light armor and shields, and with the weapons of her home region: desert (dagger, heavy lance, light lance, scimitar, shortbow, shortspear, whip); forest (blowgun, club, greatclub, handaxe, shortbow, sling, throwing axe); tundra (battleaxe, club, greataxe, handaxe, light crossbow, light pick, shortspear); mountains (battleaxe, blowgun, handaxe, shortbow, shortspear, sickle, throwing axe); plains (club, greatclub, light lance, shortbow, shortspear, spiked chain, whip). Her oaths forbid other weapons and armor heavier than light. A mystic in this class picks new spells from the druid list, and may substitute from it. Ex-nomad shaman (p.43): breaking a taboo loses all class abilities until atoned.	PRETEXT:Raised in a nomad culture and a member of a nomad tribe or clan	PRECHECKBASE:1,Will=4	PREFEAT:1,Alertness	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=8	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=4	PRESKILL:1,Survival=4	PRESPELLTYPE:1,Divine=3	SOURCEPAGE:p.40-43
